blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Soooooo....bringing this thread back from the dead in time for Easter...<br /> <br /> I noticed that the OP release page doesn't have the Bunyip tribe book listed.....is the project still going to happen? Its something I've been looking forward to in no small way (and would love to see a Croatan book but....that's another story and I get there's Croatan Song that I should be content with...but to see all dead tribes get the same White Howler treatment would be nifty).</div> </div> </div> </div>I asked about a while back... <br /> <br /> If I recall, basically other projects are taking a higher priority right now, with this book being at the bottom of said priorities. And that\u2019s why there hasn\u2019t been any significant development on the tribebook.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4418-tasti-man-lh","name":"tasti man LH","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4418_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1850"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-31T21:59:59-07:00","id":1201851,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>tasti man LH</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/946375-bunyip-book-and-the-op-2016-2017-release-pamphlet?p=1201849#post1201849\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I asked about a while back...<br /> <br /> If I recall, basically other projects are taking a higher priority right now, with this book being at the bottom of said priorities. And that\u2019s why there hasn\u2019t been any significant development on the tribebook.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Better then &quot;not happening at all&quot;....I saw it wasn't listed and I started to morn what could have been.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1179-celtspz","name":"CeltSPZ","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1179_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"835"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}